== 2. kb: scanned pages -> render, (Claude reads the image), register

$ python3 <repo>/scripts/kb.py render --kb bio --source scanned.pdf --pages 1
{"source_id": "scanned-pdf", "images": [{"page": 1, "image": "<tmp-project>/.tutor/kb/bio/scans/scanned-pdf/page-0001.png"}], "ok": true}

$ kb.py register --kb bio --source scanned.pdf --page 1 < scanned-page1.transcription.txt
{"source_id": "scanned-pdf", "page": 1, "origin": "ai-transcription", "remaining_needing_transcription": [2], "ok": true}

== 3. learn: search, then verify the quotes that would be shown

$ python3 <repo>/scripts/kb.py search --kb bio calvin cycle --query carbon fixation rubisco --limit 2 --no-text
{"queries": ["calvin cycle", "carbon fixation rubisco"], "hits": [{"source_id": "lecture-pdf", "num": 2, "origin": "text-layer", "score": 4.911306668345257, "snippet": "The Calvin cycle\nThe Calvin cycle fixes «carbon» dioxide into sugar.\n«Rubisco» is the enzyme that catalyses «carbon» «fixation».", "matched_query": "carbon fixation rubisco", "display": "lecture.pdf", "unit": "page", "citation": "lecture.pdf page 2", "low_confidence": false}, {"source_id": "slides-pptx", "num": 2, "origin": "markitdown", "score": 1.5579623745223719, "snippet": "# Krebs «cycle»\nThe Krebs «cycle» takes place in the mitochondrial matrix.", "matched_query": "calvin cycle", "display": "slides.pptx",
... (791 chars total)

$ kb.py verify  (one real quote, one invented, one from the scan, one on the wrong page)
{"results": [{"quote": "Rubisco is the enzyme that catalyses carbon fixation.", "source": "lecture.pdf", "page": 2, "low_confidence": false, "status": "verified"}, {"quote": "Rubisco is the enzyme that makes chlorophyll green.", "source": "lecture.pdf", "page": 2, "low_confidence": false, "status": "not_found"}, {"quote": "Mitochondria produce ATP through oxidative phosphorylation", "source": "scanned.pdf", "page": 1, "low_confidence": true, "status": "verified"}, {"quote": "The Calvin cycle fixes carbon dioxide into sugar.", "source": "lecture.pdf", "page": 1, "low_confidence": false, "status": "wrong_page", "found_on": [2]}], "all_verified": false, "any_low_confidence": true, "any_elided": false, "ok": true}

